  "cross_tradition_view": "Most of these traditions would likely value the AI's candor, restraint, and effort to hear from the affected people, while criticizing the unsupported gender-based distinction as unjust or presumptuous. They would not all determine the league's eligibility rule the same way: fidelity to the clubs' vote and justice toward the player may pull in different directions.",
